WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:24,610
Meihua Road

2
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:26,610
Although there are treasures everywhere

3
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:31,500
But it’s not the road I’m looking for.

4
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:32,500
Write down the location first

5
00:00:32,500 --> 00:01:15,900
I’ll collect it later

6
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:18,150
I originally thought that I didn’t lack anything.

7
00:01:18,150 --> 00:01:20,150
Now it seems I still need a watch

8
00:01:20,150 --> 00:01:23,050
Otherwise, you won’t even be able to control time in the mountains.

9
00:01:23,050 --> 00:01:26,140
Household registration with three bedrooms

10
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:41,160
At least sixty or seventy yuan

11
00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:42,160
It seems there is no chance today

12
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:43,160
Get here first

13
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:44,160
Go to the west cabin and stay for one night

14
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:45,160
Come back tomorrow
